entries.content:
-当角色成为某一等级的奴隶时候，自动弹出对应的UI
-每次奴隶等级提升自动生成介绍。
-成为某一奴隶的时候自动生成相对应的UI
-撕毁复仇卡片自动让其成为三级奴隶


ui如下：
三级奴隶（成为三级奴隶的时候自动生成如下UI）：

<div class="slave-ui-level-3" style="
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2c1810 0%, #4a2c1a 50%, #2c1810 100%);
  border: 3px solid #8b4513;
  border-radius: 15px;
  padding: 25px;
  font-family: 'Cinzel', serif;
  color: #d4af37;
  box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(139, 69, 19, 0.6);
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
">
  <div class="background-pattern" style="
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(circle at 20% 30%, rgba(139, 69, 19, 0.1) 0%, transparent 50%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 80% 70%, rgba(139, 69, 19, 0.1) 0%, transparent 50%);
    opacity: 0.3;
  "></div>

  <div class="header" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px; position: relative; z-index: 10;">
    <h2 style="
      font-size: 28px;
      text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
      margin: 0;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      color: #daa520;
    ">⚖️ 三级奴隶 ⚖️</h2>
    <div style="
      width: 80%;
      height: 2px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #8b4513, transparent);
      margin: 10px auto;
    "></div>
  </div>

  <div class="slave-info" style="position: relative; z-index: 10;">
    <div class="info-row" style="margin: 15px 0; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
      <span style="font-size: 16px; color: #cd853f;">📝 奴隶姓名:</span>
      <span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; color: #daa520;">{{slave_name}}</span>
    </div>

    <div class="info-row" style="margin: 15px 0; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
      <span style="font-size: 16px; color: #cd853f;">⏰ 契约时间:</span>
      <span style="font-size: 16px; color: #f4a460;">{{contract_time}}</span>
    </div>

    <div class="mark-status" style="
      background: rgba(139, 69, 19, 0.3);
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      border: 1px solid #8b4513;
    ">
      <h3 style="color: #daa520; margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 18px;">🌿 淫纹状态</h3>
      <p style="margin: 5px 0; color: #cd853f; font-size: 14px;">外观: 灰色荆棘藤蔓，盘踞小腹</p>
      <p style="margin: 5px 0; color: #cd853f; font-size: 14px;">状态: 休眠中 (黯淡如褪色纹身)</p>
    </div>

    <div class="punishment-control" style="
      background: rgba(139, 69, 19, 0.2);
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      border: 1px dashed #8b4513;
    ">
      <h3 style="color: #daa520; margin: 0 0 10px 0; font-size: 18px;">⚡ 惩罚权限</h3>
      <button style="
        background: linear-gradient(45deg, #8b4513, #a0522d);
        color: #fff;
        border: none;
        padding: 10px 20px;
        border-radius: 5px;
        cursor: pointer;
        font-size: 14px;
        margin: 5px;
        transition: all 0.3s;
      " onmouseover="this.style.transform='scale(1.05)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='scale(1)'">
        💫 激活针刺痛苦
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>


-二级奴隶（成为二级奴隶的时候自动生成如下UI）：

<div class="slave-ui-level-2" style="
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a0d26 0%, #2d1b3d 50%, #1a0d26 100%);
  border: 3px solid #663399;
  border-radius: 20px;
  padding: 30px;
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  color: #da70d6;
  box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(102, 51, 153, 0.8);
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
">
  <div class="background-pattern" style="
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(circle at 25% 25%, rgba(186, 85, 211, 0.1) 0%, transparent 50%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 75% 75%, rgba(186, 85, 211, 0.1) 0%, transparent 50%);
    opacity: 0.4;
  "></div>

  <div class="header" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 25px; position: relative; z-index: 10;">
    <h2 style="
      font-size: 32px;
      text-shadow: 3px 3px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.9);
      margin: 0;
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      color: #ba55d3;
      font-style: italic;
    ">🌹 二级奴隶 🌹</h2>
    <div style="
      width: 85%;
      height: 3px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #663399, #ba55d3, #663399, transparent);
      margin: 15px auto;
    "></div>
  </div>

  <div class="slave-info" style="position: relative; z-index: 10;">
    <div class="info-row" style="margin: 18px 0; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
      <span style="font-size: 18px; color: #dda0dd;">💎 奴隶姓名:</span>
      <span style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: #ba55d3; text-shadow: 1px 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);">{{slave_name}}</span>
    </div>

    <div class="info-row" style="margin: 18px 0; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
      <span style="font-size: 18px; color: #dda0dd;">🔥 欲望等级:</span>
      <span style="font-size: 18px; color: #ff69b4;">{{desire_level}}/100</span>
    </div>

    <div class="mark-status" style="
      background: rgba(102, 51, 153, 0.4);
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 15px;
      margin: 25px 0;
      border: 2px solid #663399;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 20px rgba(186, 85, 211, 0.2);
    ">
      <h3 style="color: #ba55d3; margin: 0 0 15px 0; font-size: 20px;">🥀 淫纹进化</h3>
      <p style="margin: 8px 0; color: #dda0dd; font-size: 16px;">外观: 墨黑荆棘藤蔓 + 黑玫瑰蓓蕾</p>
      <p style="margin: 8px 0; color: #dda0dd; font-size: 16px;">状态: 蓓蕾数量 {{rose_count}} 朵</p>
      <div style="
        background: rgba(186, 85, 211, 0.2);
        padding: 10px;
        border-radius: 8px;
        margin-top: 10px;
      ">
        <span style="color: #ff69b4; font-size: 14px;">💧 露珠渗出状态: {{dew_status}}</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="control-panel" style="
      background: rgba(102, 51, 153, 0.3);
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: 15px;
      border: 2px dashed #663399;
    ">
      <h3 style="color: #ba55d3; margin: 0 0 15px 0; font-size: 20px;">🔮 欲望控制</h3>
      <div style="display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <button style="
          background: linear-gradient(45deg, #663399, #8a2be2);
          color: #fff;
          border: none;
          padding: 12px 24px;
          border-radius: 8px;
          cursor: pointer;
          font-size: 16px;
          transition: all 0.3s;
          box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        " onmouseover="this.style.transform='scale(1.05)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='scale(1)'">
          💦 激发淫欲
        </button>
        <button style="
          background: linear-gradient(45deg, #8a2be2, #9932cc);
          color: #fff;
          border: none;
          padding: 12px 24px;
          border-radius: 8px;
          cursor: pointer;
          font-size: 16px;
          transition: all 0.3s;
          box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        " onmouseover="this.style.transform='scale(1.05)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='scale(1)'">
          🔒 专属绑定
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

-一级奴隶（成为一级奴隶的时候自动生成如下UI）：

<div class="slave-ui-level-1" style="
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0d0d0d 0%, #1a1a1a 25%, #2d0a0a 50%, #1a1a1a 75%, #0d0d0d 100%);
  border: 4px solid #8b0000;
  border-radius: 25px;
  padding: 35px;
  font-family: 'Crimson Text', serif;
  color: #dc143c;
  box-shadow: 0 0 50px rgba(139, 0, 0, 1.0);
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
">
  <div class="background-pattern" style="
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(circle at 30% 20%, rgba(220, 20, 60, 0.1) 0%, transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 70% 80%, rgba(220, 20, 60, 0.1) 0%, transparent 60%),
      linear-gradient(45deg, transparent 48%, rgba(139, 0, 0, 0.1) 49%, rgba(139, 0, 0, 0.1) 51%, transparent 52%);
    opacity: 0.5;
  "></div>

  <div class="header" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px; position: relative; z-index: 10;">
    <h2 style="
      font-size: 36px;
      text-shadow: 4px 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,1.0);
      margin: 0;
      letter-spacing: 5px;
      color: #ff0000;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    ">⛓️ 一级奴隶 ⛓️</h2>
    <div style="
      width: 90%;
      height: 4px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #8b0000, #dc143c, #ff0000, #dc143c, #8b0000, transparent);
      margin: 20px auto;
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(220, 20, 60, 0.8);
    "></div>
  </div>

  <div class="slave-info" style="position: relative; z-index: 10;">
    <div class="info-row" style="margin: 20px 0; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
      <span style="font-size: 20px; color: #ff6b6b;">🎭 人偶姓名:</span>
      <span style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: bold; color: #ff0000; text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);">{{slave_name}}</span>
    </div>

    <div class="info-row" style="margin: 20px 0; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
      <span style="font-size: 20px; color: #ff6b6b;">🧠 意志残留:</span>
      <span style="font-size: 18px; color: #ff4500;">{{will_remaining}}%</span>
    </div>

    <div class="mark-status" style="
      background: rgba(139, 0, 0, 0.5);
      padding: 25px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      margin: 30px 0;
      border: 3px solid #8b0000;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 30px rgba(220, 20, 60, 0.3);
    ">
      <h3 style="color: #ff0000; margin: 0 0 20px 0; font-size: 24px;">🌺 淫纹完全体</h3>
      <p style="margin: 10px 0; color: #ff6b6b; font-size: 18px;">外观: 盛开黑玫瑰 + 扭曲荆棘</p>
      <p style="margin: 10px 0; color: #ff6b6b; font-size: 18px;">特征: 花心主人瞳孔印记</p>
      <div style="
        background: rgba(220, 20, 60, 0.3);
        padding: 15px;
        border-radius: 10px;
        margin-top: 15px;
        border: 1px solid #dc143c;
      ">
        <span style="color: #ff69b4; font-size: 16px;">👁️ 主人印记: 已激活</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="absolute-control" style="
      background: rgba(139, 0, 0, 0.4);
      padding: 25px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      border: 3px dashed #8b0000;
    ">
      <h3 style="color: #ff0000; margin: 0 0 20px 0; font-size: 24px;">🎛️ 绝对支配</h3>
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 15px;">
        <button style="
          background: linear-gradient(45deg, #8b0000, #dc143c);
          color: #fff;
          border: none;
          padding: 15px 20px;
          border-radius: 10px;
          cursor: pointer;
          font-size: 16px;
          transition: all 0.3s;
          box-shadow: 0 6px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        " onmouseover="this.style.transform='scale(1.05)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='scale(1)'">
          📊 参数调节
        </button>
        <button style="
          background: linear-gradient(45deg, #dc143c, #ff0000);
          color: #fff;
          border: none;
          padding: 15px 20px;
          border-radius: 10px;
          cursor: pointer;
          font-size: 16px;
          transition: all 0.3s;
          box-shadow: 0 6px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        " onmouseover="this.style.transform='scale(1.05)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='scale(1)'">
          💥 强制高潮
        </button>
        <button style="
          background: linear-gradient(45deg, #ff0000, #ff4500);
          color: #fff;
          border: none;
          padding: 15px 20px;
          border-radius: 10px;
          cursor: pointer;
          font-size: 16px;
          transition: all 0.3s;
          box-shadow: 0 6px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        " onmouseover="this.style.transform='scale(1.05)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='scale(1)'">
          🚫 生理控制
        </button>
        <button style="
          background: linear-gradient(45deg, #ff4500, #ff6347);
          color: #fff;
          border: none;
          padding: 15px 20px;
          border-radius: 10px;
          cursor: pointer;
          font-size: 16px;
          transition: all 0.3s;
          box-shadow: 0 6px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        " onmouseover="this.style.transform='scale(1.05)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='scale(1)'">
          💀 生命权限
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

-永世之奴（成为永世之奴的时候自动生成如下UI）：

<div class="slave-ui-eternal" style="
  background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, #000000 0%, #1a0033 30%, #330066 60%, #000000 100%);
  border: 5px solid #9400d3;
  border-radius: 30px;
  padding: 40px;
  font-family: 'Libre Baskerville', serif;
  color: #e6e6fa;
  box-shadow: 0 0 60px rgba(148, 0, 211, 1.2), inset 0 0 30px rgba(148, 0, 211, 0.3);
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  animation: eternal-glow 3s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
">
  <style>
    @keyframes eternal-glow {
      0% { box-shadow: 0 0 60px rgba(148, 0, 211, 1.2), inset 0 0 30px rgba(148, 0, 211, 0.3); }
      100% { box-shadow: 0 0 80px rgba(148, 0, 211, 1.5), inset 0 0 40px rgba(148, 0, 211, 0.5); }
    }
  </style>

  <div class="background-pattern" style="
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(circle at 20% 30%, rgba(148, 0, 211, 0.2) 0%, transparent 50%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 80% 70%, rgba(148, 0, 211, 0.2) 0%, transparent 50%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(230, 230, 250, 0.1) 0%, transparent 70%);
    opacity: 0.6;
  "></div>

  <div class="header" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 35px; position: relative; z-index: 10;">
    <h2 style="
      font-size: 42px;
      text-shadow: 5px 5px 10px rgba(0,0,0,1.0), 0 0 20px rgba(148, 0, 211, 0.8);
      margin: 0;
      letter-spacing: 6px;
      color: #9400d3;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      background: linear-gradient(45deg, #9400d3, #e6e6fa, #9400d3);
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
    ">♾️ 永世之奴 ♾️</h2>
    <div style="
      width: 95%;
      height: 5px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #9400d3, #e6e6fa, #dda0dd, #e6e6fa, #9400d3, transparent);
      margin: 25px auto;
      box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(148, 0, 211, 1.0);
      border-radius: 2px;
    "></div>
  </div>

  <div class="slave-info" style="position: relative; z-index: 10;">
    <div class="info-row" style="margin: 25px 0; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
      <span style="font-size: 22px; color: #dda0dd;">👑 永恒归属:</span>
      <span style="font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; color: #9400d3; text-shadow: 3px 3px 6px rgba(0,0,0,1.0);">{{slave_name}}</span>
    </div>

    <div class="info-row" style="margin: 25px 0; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
      <span style="font-size: 22px; color: #dda0dd;">🌌 灵魂绑定:</span>
      <span style="font-size: 20px; color: #e6e6fa;">永恒 ∞</span>
    </div>

    <div class="mark-status" style="
      background: rgba(148, 0, 211, 0.6);
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 25px;
      margin: 35px 0;
      border: 4px solid #9400d3;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 40px rgba(230, 230, 250, 0.3), 0 0 20px rgba(148, 0, 211, 0.8);
    ">
      <h3 style="color: #e6e6fa; margin: 0 0 25px 0; font-size: 28px; text-align: center;">🔮 概念烙印</h3>
      <p style="margin: 12px 0; color: #dda0dd; font-size: 20px;">形态: 超越物理的法则投影</p>
      <p style="margin: 12px 0; color: #dda0dd; font-size: 20px;">表现: 瞳孔黑焰 / 锁链影子</p>
      <div style="
        background: rgba(230, 230, 250, 0.3);
        padding: 20px;
        border-radius: 15px;
        margin-top: 20px;
        border: 2px solid #e6e6fa;
      ">
        <span style="color: #9400d3; font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold;">🌟 世界法则改写: 已完成</span>
